174
00:07:16,060 --> 00:07:17,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Weren't you fully prepared?</font>

175
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:18,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Weren't you confident?</font>

176
00:07:18,700 --> 00:07:20,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What was that up there?</font>

177
00:07:20,050 --> 00:07:20,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You stammered through the whole thing</font>

178
00:07:20,930 --> 00:07:21,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and made a fool of yourself.</font>

179
00:07:21,810 --> 00:07:22,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Such a good...</font>

180
00:07:22,290 --> 00:07:23,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough.</font>

181
00:07:23,100 --> 00:07:24,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you yelling at Mao?</font>

182
00:07:24,690 --> 00:07:26,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He did a good job.</font>

183
00:07:29,410 --> 00:07:30,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What else could I do?</font>

184
00:07:31,020 --> 00:07:31,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was the only way to let</font>

185
00:07:31,900 --> 00:07:33,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">management experience it firsthand.</font>

186
00:07:33,410 --> 00:07:34,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We work ourselves to the bone</font>

187
00:07:34,930 --> 00:07:36,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">down there every day.</font>

188
00:07:36,170 --> 00:07:37,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We give it everything we've got.</font>

189
00:07:37,260 --> 00:07:39,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're lucky if management notices half.</font>

190
00:07:39,630 --> 00:07:40,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's true,</font>

191
00:07:40,890 --> 00:07:41,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but around here,</font>

192
00:07:41,820 --> 00:07:43,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">being good at the job isn't enough.</font>

193
00:07:43,180 --> 00:07:44,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need to know what to say</font>

194
00:07:44,340 --> 00:07:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and how to play the game.</font>

195
00:07:47,710 --> 00:07:48,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

196
00:07:49,260 --> 00:07:51,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the four of us can handle the work just fine,</font>

197
00:07:51,900 --> 00:07:53,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but do any of us look like we know how to play the game?</font>

198
00:08:12,420 --> 00:08:13,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Folks,</font>

199
00:08:13,590 --> 00:08:15,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is this your first time in Fushan?</font>

200
00:08:15,710 --> 00:08:17,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's our first time here.</font>

201
00:08:17,350 --> 00:08:18,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're so excited!</font>

202
00:08:18,710 --> 00:08:19,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Young man,</font>

203
00:08:19,660 --> 00:08:20,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">take a picture for us.</font>

204
00:08:21,230 --> 00:08:21,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

205
00:08:21,570 --> 00:08:22,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here you go.</font>

206
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:27,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm a local.</font>

207
00:08:27,950 --> 00:08:29,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you about the place.</font>

208
00:08:29,310 --> 00:08:31,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've got mountains and sea.</font>

209
00:08:31,140 --> 00:08:32,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's truly a blessed place.</font>

210
00:08:32,500 --> 00:08:33,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but it's full of life.</font>

211
00:08:34,070 --> 00:08:34,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll have</font>

212
00:08:34,930 --> 00:08:36,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a great time here.</font>

213
00:08:41,380 --> 00:08:44,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Qingliangshan Residential Compound]</font>

214
00:09:29,230 --> 00:09:30,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing, Dad?</font>

215
00:09:30,330 --> 00:09:32,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wang Zhiyuan, Fleet Employee, Wang Can's Father]</font>

216
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:33,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since when do we have the tradition</font>

217
00:09:33,750 --> 00:09:34,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of bathing in the morning?</font>

218
00:09:37,110 --> 00:09:38,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sweating it out, rehydrating,</font>

219
00:09:39,280 --> 00:09:40,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and boosting</font>

220
00:09:40,630 --> 00:09:41,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my metabolism.</font>

221
00:09:44,160 --> 00:09:44,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Remember a few years ago,</font>

222
00:09:44,990 --> 00:09:46,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when we still had money?</font>

223
00:09:46,750 --> 00:09:48,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't I take that group tour to Yunnan?</font>

224
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:50,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The local guide</font>

225
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:51,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">took us to a longevity village.</font>

226
00:09:52,110 --> 00:09:53,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">People there live past 100 like it's nothing.</font>

227
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:56,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know what their secret is?</font>

228
00:09:57,470 --> 00:09:57,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

229
00:09:57,990 --> 00:09:58,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's</font>

230
00:09:58,950 --> 00:10:00,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a morning bath.</font>

231
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:01,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They call it a "morning soak."</font>

232
00:10:01,640 --> 00:10:02,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It gets the blood flowing,</font>

233
00:10:02,750 --> 00:10:03,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wakes you right up,</font>

234
00:10:03,630 --> 00:10:05,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and starts your day off right.</font>

235
00:10:06,870 --> 00:10:07,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well?</font>

236
00:10:07,990 --> 00:10:08,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A bath with a fruit platter.</font>

237
00:10:08,890 --> 00:10:09,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fancy, huh?</font>

238
00:10:10,630 --> 00:10:11,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dad,</font>

239
00:10:11,870 --> 00:10:12,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with the way we're living now,</font>

240
00:10:12,690 --> 00:10:13,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you still want a long life?</font>

241
00:10:14,990 --> 00:10:16,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We work at Qingliangshan.</font>

242
00:10:16,210 --> 00:10:17,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've got to think bigger.</font>

243
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm always telling</font>

244
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:21,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">those young college grads on the fleet</font>

245
00:10:21,520 --> 00:10:23,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that healthy habits should start young.</font>

246
00:10:24,230 --> 00:10:24,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My goal is</font>

247
00:10:25,040 --> 00:10:26,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to keep serving others</font>

248
00:10:26,230 --> 00:10:27,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so they never have to serve me.</font>

249
00:10:29,610 --> 00:10:30,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dad,</font>

250
00:10:30,930 --> 00:10:32,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then why don't you serve me first?</font>

251
00:10:32,620 --> 00:10:33,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I forgot to flush.</font>

252
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:35,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Son.</font>

253
00:10:35,970 --> 00:10:36,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Son!</font>

254
00:10:37,750 --> 00:10:39,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You won't get a ride to Qingliangshan this early.</font>

255
00:10:39,630 --> 00:10:40,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can take you on my scooter!</font>

256
00:10:53,780 --> 00:10:55,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[No drivers available]</font>

257
00:11:05,750 --> 00:11:06,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Son,</font>

258
00:11:06,920 --> 00:11:07,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So</font>

259
00:11:07,700 --> 00:11:10,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll have to hop on my little scooter of fatherly love.</font>

260
00:11:13,890 --> 00:11:14,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, thanks.</font>

261
00:11:20,180 --> 00:11:22,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Please obey traffic regulations]</font>

262
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:23,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nice and steady.</font>

263
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:26,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A father's love really is unwavering.</font>

264
00:11:26,910 --> 00:11:27,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See?</font>

265
00:11:30,910 --> 00:11:31,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Son,</font>

266
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:34,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">good thing your mom's away on business,</font>

267
00:11:35,030 --> 00:11:37,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or you wouldn't be starting with the mortuary prep team today.</font>

268
00:11:38,030 --> 00:11:39,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But once she's back tomorrow,</font>

269
00:11:39,630 --> 00:11:40,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this fatherly love of mine</font>

270
00:11:40,550 --> 00:11:41,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">might not be enough to protect you.</font>

271
00:11:42,150 --> 00:11:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way.</font>

272
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:44,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your son's sunk this low,</font>

273
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you</font>

274
00:11:46,270 --> 00:11:47,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">had a big hand in it.</font>

275
00:11:49,670 --> 00:11:50,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you something.</font>

276
00:11:51,430 --> 00:11:52,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The only thing I'm good at</font>

277
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:53,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is passing the buck.</font>

278
00:11:53,910 --> 00:11:55,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never make life hard for myself.</font>

279
00:11:56,650 --> 00:11:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No wonder I'm the same.</font>

280
00:11:58,320 --> 00:11:59,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It runs in the family.</font>

281
00:12:02,860 --> 00:12:04,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Grooming Mirror]</font>

282
00:12:05,750 --> 00:12:06,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu,</font>

283
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:08,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when we had barbecue the other day,</font>

284
00:12:08,750 --> 00:12:09,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this girl asked me</font>

285
00:12:09,630 --> 00:12:10,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why we were so fair-skinned</font>

286
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:12,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and what brand of sunscreen we used.</font>

287
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:14,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What brand?</font>

288
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:16,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The underground brand.</font>

289
00:12:16,560 --> 00:12:18,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I'm a guy.</font>

290
00:12:18,280 --> 00:12:19,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With my skin this fair,</font>

291
00:12:19,540 --> 00:12:21,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">people are going to call me a pretty boy.</font>

292
00:12:22,020 --> 00:12:22,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's fine.</font>

293
00:12:23,210 --> 00:12:24,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once you retire,</font>

294
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:26,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can hit the square-dancing scene</font>

295
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:27,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as an old pretty boy.</font>

296
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:30,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Morning!</font>

297
00:12:30,780 --> 00:12:31,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Morning.</font>

298
00:12:35,090 --> 00:12:35,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

299
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:37,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">did you run here from home again?</font>

300
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:38,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That takes an hour, doesn't it?</font>

301
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:39,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course.</font>

302
00:12:39,760 --> 00:12:40,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A beautiful day</font>

303
00:12:40,760 --> 00:12:41,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">starts with exercise.</font>

304
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:46,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Midlife crises are terrifying.</font>

305
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:48,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I swear he keeps getting thinner.</font>

306
00:12:49,390 --> 00:12:50,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And weirder.</font>

307
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:52,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ever since his wife said</font>

308
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:54,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">middle-aged men smell worse than decomposing bodies,</font>

309
00:12:54,510 --> 00:12:55,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he's been like this.</font>

310
00:12:55,480 --> 00:12:56,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao Erzhe, you're cleaning the restroom after work!</font>

311
00:13:00,540 --> 00:13:05,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Please obey traffic regulations]</font>

312
00:13:05,860 --> 00:13:11,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Keep Both Worlds Satisfied]</font>

313
00:13:14,220 --> 00:13:14,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Son.</font>

314
00:13:18,240 --> 00:13:18,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

315
00:13:19,730 --> 00:13:21,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These hands of yours</font>

316
00:13:22,670 --> 00:13:24,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">might touch a body today.</font>

317
00:13:26,880 --> 00:13:27,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you remember</font>

318
00:13:28,280 --> 00:13:29,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what happened right here</font>

319
00:13:29,280 --> 00:13:30,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">four years ago on your first day</font>

320
00:13:30,880 --> 00:13:31,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Body Transfer Area]</font>

321
00:13:31,760 --> 00:13:32,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as an intern?</font>

322
00:13:32,650 --> 00:13:35,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Transfer & Registration Room]</font>

323
00:13:35,670 --> 00:13:37,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So this is the mortuary prep team?</font>

324
00:13:37,400 --> 00:13:38,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Internship four years ago]
We're not touching bodies</font>

325
00:13:38,810 --> 00:13:40,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on our first day, are we?</font>

326
00:13:40,190 --> 00:13:41,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, no. My hands are already shaking.</font>

327
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:52,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Son!</font>

328
00:13:53,890 --> 00:13:55,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our land back home got requisitioned!</font>

329
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:58,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're going to be rich!</font>

330
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Son, get in!</font>

331
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:02,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dad?</font>

332
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you waiting for? Get in!</font>

333
00:14:07,640 --> 00:14:08,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

334
00:14:09,400 --> 00:14:10,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you touched one yet?</font>

335
00:14:12,980 --> 00:14:13,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get in!</font>

336
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:18,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm getting you out</font>

337
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:18,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the nick of time!</font>

338
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:20,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My friends are still there!</font>

339
00:14:20,090 --> 00:14:22,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll buy you new friends!</font>

340
00:14:22,290 --> 00:14:26,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Body Transfer Area]</font>

341
00:14:28,790 --> 00:14:30,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After all this time,</font>

342
00:14:31,670 --> 00:14:32,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you ended up back here.</font>

343
00:14:33,010 --> 00:14:34,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry, son.</font>

344
00:14:35,180 --> 00:14:35,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right, enough.</font>

345
00:14:36,010 --> 00:14:37,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't get emotional.</font>

346
00:14:37,250 --> 00:14:38,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should get to work too.</font>

347
00:14:38,230 --> 00:14:39,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Body Transfer Area]</font>

348
00:14:39,090 --> 00:14:41,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I picked you up here last time. Now I'm bringing you back.</font>

349
00:14:41,090 --> 00:14:41,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you trying to say?</font>

350
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:42,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go now.</font>

351
00:14:42,610 --> 00:14:43,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm leaving now.</font>

352
00:14:43,800 --> 00:14:44,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Work hard, okay?</font>

353
00:14:54,140 --> 00:14:57,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Transfer & Registration Room]</font>

354
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:58,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good news!</font>

355
00:14:58,720 --> 00:14:59,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've got a new coworker!</font>

356
00:14:59,690 --> 00:15:00,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, come closer.</font>

357
00:15:00,920 --> 00:15:01,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who is it?</font>

358
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:02,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're about to find out.</font>

359
00:15:02,630 --> 00:15:03,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look happy.</font>

360
00:15:03,680 --> 00:15:04,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get excited.</font>

361
00:15:05,230 --> 00:15:06,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Excited! - Hurry up.</font>

362
00:15:06,470 --> 00:15:06,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

363
00:15:11,350 --> 00:15:12,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can!</font>

364
00:15:13,440 --> 00:15:14,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me introduce you.</font>

365
00:15:14,470 --> 00:15:15,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Dandan.</font>

366
00:15:16,230 --> 00:15:16,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan.</font>

367
00:15:16,750 --> 00:15:18,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can, Mr. Wang's son?</font>

368
00:15:18,040 --> 00:15:18,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

369
00:15:18,510 --> 00:15:19,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're back?</font>

370
00:15:19,750 --> 00:15:20,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Welcome.</font>

371
00:15:20,930 --> 00:15:21,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

372
00:15:21,400 --> 00:15:22,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's been so many years.</font>

373
00:15:22,100 --> 00:15:22,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at him.</font>

374
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:23,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a fine young man.</font>

375
00:15:23,990 --> 00:15:25,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A masterpiece of nature, right?</font>

376
00:15:26,590 --> 00:15:27,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is...</font>

377
00:15:27,270 --> 00:15:27,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need</font>

378
00:15:27,990 --> 00:15:28,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to introduce them.</font>

379
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:29,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're all childhood friends.</font>

380
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:30,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chen Hexu.</font>

381
00:15:30,990 --> 00:15:32,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The heroine of our class.</font>

382
00:15:32,680 --> 00:15:34,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the cremator disassembly and assembly contest,</font>

383
00:15:34,230 --> 00:15:34,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she took first place.</font>

384
00:15:34,920 --> 00:15:36,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She could crack walnuts</font>

385
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with a screwdriver in one hand.</font>

386
00:15:36,840 --> 00:15:37,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

387
00:15:37,460 --> 00:15:37,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

388
00:15:38,660 --> 00:15:39,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

389
00:15:40,110 --> 00:15:41,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you acting so cold?</font>

390
00:15:41,310 --> 00:15:42,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you forget? We used to play together.</font>

391
00:15:42,760 --> 00:15:44,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One time, there was a banquet at my place.</font>

392
00:15:44,480 --> 00:15:46,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They told us to move a table.</font>

393
00:15:46,160 --> 00:15:47,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I lifted one side, and you lifted the other.</font>

394
00:15:47,480 --> 00:15:49,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I shouted, "Lift the coffin!"</font>

395
00:15:49,790 --> 00:15:51,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And my mom kicked us from behind.</font>

396
00:15:53,270 --> 00:15:55,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think that was me.</font>

397
00:15:59,030 --> 00:15:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, right!</font>

398
00:16:00,030 --> 00:16:01,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was your family's banquet.</font>

399
00:16:01,510 --> 00:16:02,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's right.</font>

400
00:16:02,310 --> 00:16:03,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We carried it together.</font>

401
00:16:03,070 --> 00:16:03,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Later,</font>

402
00:16:03,760 --> 00:16:04,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">while the adults were chatting,</font>

403
00:16:04,960 --> 00:16:05,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we kids had nothing to do,</font>

404
00:16:05,910 --> 00:16:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so we played house.</font>

405
00:16:06,870 --> 00:16:07,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You took</font>

406
00:16:07,510 --> 00:16:08,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">several paper dolls from that funeral hall.</font>

407
00:16:08,790 --> 00:16:09,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The boy and girl attendants.</font>

408
00:16:09,510 --> 00:16:10,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- We pretended we were filming a movie.
- That was with me.</font>

409
00:16:11,590 --> 00:16:12,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were there too.</font>

410
00:16:12,270 --> 00:16:12,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then we</font>

411
00:16:12,950 --> 00:16:14,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- filmed a movie together.
- He wasn't there.</font>

412
00:16:14,760 --> 00:16:15,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just me.</font>

413
00:16:20,550 --> 00:16:21,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, right. I remember now.</font>

414
00:16:21,870 --> 00:16:23,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You said you wanted to apply to film school,</font>

415
00:16:23,310 --> 00:16:23,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">didn't you?</font>

416
00:16:23,760 --> 00:16:24,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I remember it all.</font>

417
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:25,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, don't worry.</font>

418
00:16:25,870 --> 00:16:26,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're all childhood friends.</font>

419
00:16:26,960 --> 00:16:27,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We grew up together.</font>

420
00:16:27,790 --> 00:16:28,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We don't need to build a bond.</font>

421
00:16:29,240 --> 00:16:30,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's already there.</font>

422
00:16:30,310 --> 00:16:30,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now that I'm</font>

423
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:32,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">back at Qingliangshan,</font>

424
00:16:32,110 --> 00:16:33,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll make our team shine!</font>

425
00:16:33,790 --> 00:16:34,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well said!</font>

426
00:16:34,510 --> 00:16:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Great!</font>

427
00:16:44,640 --> 00:16:45,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let bygones</font>

428
00:16:45,720 --> 00:16:46,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">be bygones,</font>

429
00:16:46,520 --> 00:16:46,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">okay?</font>

430
00:16:47,270 --> 00:16:48,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're coworkers now.</font>

431
00:16:48,510 --> 00:16:49,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

432
00:16:49,550 --> 00:16:50,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be professional.</font>

433
00:16:52,510 --> 00:16:53,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan, let's get to work.</font>

434
00:16:53,760 --> 00:16:54,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, go get ready.</font>

435
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:56,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on, you'll sit here.</font>

436
00:16:56,870 --> 00:16:57,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it.</font>

437
00:16:58,760 --> 00:16:59,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me see what work</font>

438
00:16:59,580 --> 00:17:00,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can assign you today.</font>

439
00:17:02,420 --> 00:17:03,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Too professional.</font>

440
00:17:03,090 --> 00:17:04,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Registration, Standard Preparation]
Too professional.</font>

441
00:17:04,120 --> 00:17:05,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Embalming Procedures]
Too professional.</font>

442
00:17:05,090 --> 00:17:06,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Complex Case Procedures]
Too professional.</font>

443
00:17:06,160 --> 00:17:07,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one's cleaning the restroom today.</font>

444
00:17:12,070 --> 00:17:12,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First day on the job.</font>

445
00:17:13,270 --> 00:17:13,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can do it.</font>

446
00:17:15,400 --> 00:17:16,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come upstairs first</font>

447
00:17:16,030 --> 00:17:16,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to complete your onboarding.</font>

448
00:17:17,070 --> 00:17:18,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'll show you around.</font>

449
00:17:28,760 --> 00:17:29,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well?</font>

450
00:17:29,870 --> 00:17:30,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From here,</font>

451
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:31,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">doesn't Qingliangshan look pretty big?</font>

452
00:17:34,070 --> 00:17:34,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back then,</font>

453
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:36,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I helped build Qingliangshan</font>

454
00:17:37,310 --> 00:17:39,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">alongside your parents.</font>

455
00:17:39,460 --> 00:17:40,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just think how many years it's been.</font>

456
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:43,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were away for years.</font>

457
00:17:43,510 --> 00:17:44,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me show you around.</font>

458
00:17:45,320 --> 00:17:46,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Auditorium Building]
The auditorium building is new.</font>

459
00:17:47,020 --> 00:17:47,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Operations Building]</font>

460
00:17:47,720 --> 00:17:48,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The memorial halls</font>

461
00:17:48,350 --> 00:17:49,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and general office area are inside.</font>

462
00:17:50,310 --> 00:17:51,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The funeral halls and cremation rooms have all been reinforced.</font>

463
00:17:52,350 --> 00:17:53,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The dorms and cafeteria have been renovated too.</font>

464
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:56,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The entire river system has been landscaped.</font>

465
00:17:56,250 --> 00:17:56,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Anfu Columbarium]</font>

466
00:17:57,640 --> 00:17:59,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Forensic Science Center and Logistics Department</font>

467
00:17:59,650 --> 00:18:00,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have also moved upstairs.</font>

468
00:18:01,030 --> 00:18:02,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The only one left is our mortuary prep team.</font>

469
00:18:03,480 --> 00:18:04,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm telling you,</font>

470
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:05,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">coming back was the right choice.</font>

471
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:11,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Remember that river?</font>

472
00:18:13,070 --> 00:18:14,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It used to be just a little stream.</font>

473
00:18:14,550 --> 00:18:15,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Later, the government allocated</font>

474
00:18:16,030 --> 00:18:17,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">special funds for a major renovation,</font>

475
00:18:17,960 --> 00:18:18,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">turning it into the crossing</font>

476
00:18:19,030 --> 00:18:20,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">where the deceased depart for the other world.</font>

477
00:18:21,030 --> 00:18:21,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why it's now called</font>

478
00:18:22,160 --> 00:18:23,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Duyue River.</font>

479
00:18:23,310 --> 00:18:24,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How's that? Nice name, right?</font>

480
00:18:26,760 --> 00:18:27,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you laughing at?</font>

481
00:18:28,240 --> 00:18:29,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing.</font>

482
00:18:29,200 --> 00:18:29,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing.</font>

483
00:18:29,550 --> 00:18:30,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me.</font>

484
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:33,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When we were kids,</font>

485
00:18:33,760 --> 00:18:34,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we gave it a name.</font>

486
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:36,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did you call it?</font>

487
00:18:38,030 --> 00:18:39,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was just a joke. I...</font>

488
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:40,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, tell me.</font>

489
00:18:42,960 --> 00:18:43,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Little Yellow Springs.</font>

490
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:51,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know, that's pretty creative.</font>

491
00:18:51,760 --> 00:18:53,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's more vivid than Duyue River.</font>

492
00:18:53,550 --> 00:18:54,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

493
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:54,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really.</font>

494
00:18:56,720 --> 00:18:57,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And look</font>

495
00:18:58,440 --> 00:18:59,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at all the landscaping.</font>

496
00:19:00,030 --> 00:19:00,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was all newly done.</font>

497
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:02,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, families have a place</font>

498
00:19:02,590 --> 00:19:03,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to rest while waiting</font>

499
00:19:03,760 --> 00:19:04,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the ashes.</font>

500
00:19:05,670 --> 00:19:06,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's come a long way.</font>

501
00:19:10,390 --> 00:19:10,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can,</font>

502
00:19:11,470 --> 00:19:12,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you went all the way to Beijing.</font>

503
00:19:13,150 --> 00:19:13,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you come back?</font>

504
00:19:20,670 --> 00:19:21,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why else?</font>

505
00:19:22,260 --> 00:19:23,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because I missed you.</font>

506
00:19:23,470 --> 00:19:24,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be serious.</font>

507
00:19:25,740 --> 00:19:26,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now that you're back,</font>

508
00:19:26,740 --> 00:19:27,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">take your time to settle in.</font>

509
00:19:28,190 --> 00:19:29,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't put too much pressure on yourself.</font>

510
00:19:29,910 --> 00:19:30,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In our line of work,</font>

511
00:19:31,630 --> 00:19:33,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we not only have to care for the deceased</font>

512
00:19:33,740 --> 00:19:34,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but also take care of ourselves.</font>

513
00:19:35,230 --> 00:19:35,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Remember what it says</font>

514
00:19:35,950 --> 00:19:37,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the employee handbook?</font>

515
00:19:37,230 --> 00:19:39,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Put the deceased to eternal rest.</font>

516
00:19:40,820 --> 00:19:43,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help the living find peace."</font>

517
00:19:44,060 --> 00:19:44,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I think</font>

518
00:19:44,910 --> 00:19:45,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they left out</font>

519
00:19:45,500 --> 00:19:46,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the most important line.</font>

520
00:19:46,430 --> 00:19:48,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Protect our employees at all times."</font>

521
00:19:48,670 --> 00:19:49,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Remember:</font>

522
00:19:50,470 --> 00:19:51,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't take</font>

523
00:19:51,990 --> 00:19:53,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">everything too personally,</font>

524
00:19:54,060 --> 00:19:56,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because we encounter many different kinds</font>

525
00:19:56,390 --> 00:19:57,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of deceased every day.</font>

526
00:19:58,470 --> 00:19:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll understand someday.</font>

527
00:20:01,670 --> 00:20:02,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, sir.</font>

528
00:20:23,710 --> 00:20:24,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right, let's go back.</font>

529
00:20:25,150 --> 00:20:25,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen,</font>

530
00:20:25,990 --> 00:20:28,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you need to clean the restroom carefully today.</font>

531
00:20:30,530 --> 00:20:33,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wang Can, Intern Embalmer]</font>

532
00:20:41,230 --> 00:20:42,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Dandan. - What's wrong?</font>

