713
00:30:12,820 --> 00:30:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or it could contaminate the deceased.</font>

714
00:30:15,630 --> 00:30:17,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't handle this, can you?</font>

715
00:30:18,190 --> 00:30:19,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you can't, leave.</font>

716
00:30:19,990 --> 00:30:21,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It wouldn't be your first time.</font>

717
00:30:28,300 --> 00:30:29,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why haven't you two gone to lunch?</font>

718
00:30:29,780 --> 00:30:30,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're serving baozi today.</font>

719
00:30:32,230 --> 00:30:33,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really? What filling?</font>

720
00:30:34,020 --> 00:30:35,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your favorite. Pork and scallion.</font>

721
00:30:35,910 --> 00:30:37,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll wheel the deceased inside first.</font>

722
00:30:37,870 --> 00:30:38,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go with you.</font>

723
00:31:04,950 --> 00:31:05,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In this line of work,</font>

724
00:31:06,150 --> 00:31:07,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the hardest cases are children.</font>

725
00:31:07,870 --> 00:31:09,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been doing this for years,</font>

726
00:31:09,910 --> 00:31:10,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I still can't take it.</font>

727
00:31:11,740 --> 00:31:12,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go home and get some sleep.</font>

728
00:31:13,100 --> 00:31:13,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try not to dwell on it.</font>

729
00:32:22,740 --> 00:32:23,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My condolences.</font>

730
00:32:50,040 --> 00:32:51,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Welcome to Good Night.</font>

731
00:32:52,060 --> 00:32:53,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Three years ago, Good Night]
Today, I'd like to make you</font>

732
00:32:53,870 --> 00:32:54,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">one of my own signature cocktails:</font>

733
00:32:55,270 --> 00:32:56,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Three Moments of Life.</font>

734
00:32:57,700 --> 00:32:58,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As the name suggests,</font>

735
00:32:58,620 --> 00:32:59,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it represents</font>

736
00:32:59,220 --> 00:33:00,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">three stages of life.</font>

737
00:33:01,870 --> 00:33:03,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When we're first born,</font>

738
00:33:03,270 --> 00:33:05,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we're like the first snow of winter,</font>

739
00:33:05,390 --> 00:33:05,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">pure and untouched.</font>

740
00:33:06,580 --> 00:33:08,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So the first moment is called</font>

741
00:33:09,020 --> 00:33:09,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Birth.</font>

742
00:33:12,350 --> 00:33:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if you're born in summer?</font>

743
00:33:16,910 --> 00:33:18,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then go drink a beer.</font>

744
00:33:19,270 --> 00:33:19,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Next,</font>

745
00:33:20,060 --> 00:33:21,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we gradually grow up</font>

746
00:33:22,140 --> 00:33:23,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and meet all kinds of people,</font>

747
00:33:23,350 --> 00:33:25,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">creating all kinds of chemistry.</font>

748
00:33:25,500 --> 00:33:26,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's the second moment:</font>

749
00:33:27,100 --> 00:33:28,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Encounter.</font>

750
00:33:30,220 --> 00:33:31,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And the third moment</font>

751
00:33:31,310 --> 00:33:32,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is my own name:</font>

752
00:33:32,830 --> 00:33:33,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can.
[*shine]</font>

753
00:33:34,430 --> 00:33:35,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope everyone can live brilliantly</font>

754
00:33:36,390 --> 00:33:37,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and embrace life</font>

755
00:33:39,470 --> 00:33:40,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the face of death.</font>

756
00:33:42,350 --> 00:33:43,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lemon. Syrup.</font>

757
00:33:43,910 --> 00:33:44,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bitters. Liquor.</font>

758
00:33:44,950 --> 00:33:46,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sweet, sour, bitter, and fiery, all in one glass.</font>

759
00:33:46,790 --> 00:33:48,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's a pretty short life.</font>

760
00:33:48,350 --> 00:33:49,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cremation right after birth?</font>

761
00:33:55,430 --> 00:33:55,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try it.</font>

762
00:34:01,350 --> 00:34:01,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How is it?</font>

763
00:34:03,180 --> 00:34:05,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your pitch is better than your drink.</font>

764
00:34:05,020 --> 00:34:05,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But it's fine.</font>

765
00:34:05,700 --> 00:34:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll just say I paid for the comedy.</font>

766
00:34:31,350 --> 00:34:31,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perfect.</font>

767
00:34:32,180 --> 00:34:33,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got a lot to learn.</font>

768
00:34:33,990 --> 00:34:35,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course it tastes good.</font>

769
00:34:35,270 --> 00:34:35,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know.</font>

770
